---
import HobbyOrbit from "./HobbyOrbit.astro";
---

<section
  id="about"
  class="relative flex min-h-screen flex-col justify-center px-6 py-24 md:py-32"
>
  <div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-5xl gap-12 md:grid-cols-[1.15fr_1fr] md:items-center">
    <div>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">About</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 border-l-2 border-accent/40 pl-5 text-slate-600">
        <slot>
          <p>
            Hey there! I'm Andrei. I'm pursuing an MSc in Data Science at
            Uppsala University, developing a deeper understanding of how data
            describes the world, and staying curious about technology,
            entrepreneurship, sustainability, and AI ethics.
          </p>
          <p>
            I'd rather be a problem solver who reaches for the right tool for
            the job than an expert in one technology, currently as a Data
            Engineer at Endava. I value autonomy, transparency, and teams that
            challenge me and give me space to innovate.
          </p>
          <p>
            Beyond work and education, I volunteer at and help organize European
            events, bringing talented people together and building space for
            good ideas. I'm also a core team member of EuroTech Federation on
            community and fellowship.
          </p>
          <p>
            Outside of engineering, I read, especially philosophy and classic
            literature, and spend as much time as I can hiking, running, and
            traveling.
          </p>
        </slot>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <HobbyOrbit />
      <p class="mt-6 text-center text-sm text-slate-400">
        Literature, traveling, hiking, running, philosophy, and culture.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
